gantt
    title SanServeAll Development Timeline (16 Weeks)
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat  %b %d
    todayMarker off

    section Foundation
    Project Setup                  :done,    f1, 2026-08-10, 7d
    Database Foundation            :         f2, after f1, 7d
    Auth & RBAC                    :         f3, after f2, 7d

    section Transactional Core
    POS Module (Ordering)          :         t1, after f3, 7d
    POS Module (Payment+Receipt)   :         t2, after t1, 7d
    Inventory Module               :         t3, after t2, 7d
    KaHero Batch-Import (Alangilan):         t4, after t3, 7d

    section Production & Analytics
    Commissary/Production Module  :         p1, after t4, 7d
    Analytics Dashboards           :         p2, after p1, 7d

    section Intelligence & DSS
    AI Forecasting Core (ARIMA)    :         a1, after p2, 7d
    AI Risk Class. + NL Insights   :         a2, after a1, 7d

    section Hardening
    Settings + Bluetooth Printer   :         h1, after a2, 7d

    section Deployment & Launch
    Integration Testing            :active,  d1, after h1, 7d
    User Acceptance Testing (UAT)  :         d2, after d1, 7d
    Staging Fixes + Backup Drill   :         d3, after d2, 7d
    Production Launch              :milestone, d4, after d3, 1d
